ns a unique package of hard to  find nutrients including vitamin d and  omega-3 fats the applegate naturals do  good dogs available at whole foods in  walmart are made with regeneratively  sourced beef that is 100 natural and  grass-fed in fact they boast the world's  first regenerative sourcing verification  like all their products they contain no  antibiotics ever and are humanely raised  instead of high fat dressings and  condiments flavor your proteins with  nutritious toppings grilled corn pickles  and salsa fresh cravings never cooked or  pasteurized refrigerated salsa from  walmart is made with vine ripened  tomatoes crisp vegetables and zesty  peppers so it tastes homemade finally  support your digestion this summer with  probiotics probiotics are beneficial  bacteria that support digestion and  immune health and are found in foods  like yogurt sauerkraut and tempeh  consider a science-backed probiotic  supplement like trubiotics capsules or  gummies available on amazon which  features select research-backed  probiotics that are designed to  withstand their journey through the body  to land where they're needed in the  gastrointestinal tract so they can  support healthy microbiome diversity and  digestive and immune health i hope you  enjoyed these tips and recipes you can  find everything on my website  nutritionbymia.com  and instagram nutritionbymia where i  also share healthy recipes and nutrition  tips daily
 

